+/-!
+Graph-independent measurable readout of the actual flagged unranked timed
+observation, followed by actual complete-source factorization.
+Contributor: dot (OpenAI), 30 October 2026. BUILD PENDING.
+No finite-window recurrence/reconstruction or full CB-MSCI-001 claim.
+The readout is an ENNReal mass function, not claimed normalized off support.
+-/
+noncomputable section
+set_option autoImplicit false
+set_option backward.isDefEq.respectTransparency false
+namespace ResearchCommons.MSCI.JC69Factorization
+open MeasureTheory ProbabilityTheory Nanuq.Source GProgram.SourceForest GProgram.G5
+open UnifiedLean.Source.UniformizedSourceStep UnifiedLean.Source.FiniteSourceSnapshot
